+
+The supplied repository declares Go 1.26.5 and a `tool` block, while the validation environment used for P06 had Go 1.23.2 and no network access. These narrow source-compatible stubs exist only so the P06 packages and their pre-existing `pkg/flow` tests can be compiled in GOPATH mode.
